- `performance.analysis_max_workers`
- `performance.ctrlpp_max_workers`
- `performance.live_ai_max_workers`
- `performance.report_max_workers`
- `autofix.enabled_default`
- `autofix.block_on_regression_default`
- `autofix.session_ttl_sec`
- `autofix.session_max_entries`
- `autofix.proposal_limit_per_session`
